# Seed material, not runtime material.
#
# The book text and the comic manifests are read once, by `prisma/seed.ts`, on
# the machine that fills the database. The running site reads books out of
# Postgres and never opens these files, so uploading 12MB of them to every
# deploy buys nothing. The .ts files beside them stay: seed.ts imports their
# types, and the build typechecks it.
src/content/books/
src/content/comics/

# Written for people, not for the server.
docs/

# Local scratch.
.playwright-mcp/
prisma/dev.db*
